      <h1 class="article-title">Merzouga Luxury Desert Camp: The Complete Erg Chebbi Glamping Guide</h1>
      <p class="article-subtitle">
        What genuine Sahara luxury really looks like, how to avoid noisy perimeter camps, and why en-suite hot water changes everything.
      </p>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>Published: <strong>October 2026</strong></span>
        <span>Curators: <strong>Hamza &amp; Abdelhakim (Roam Morocco Co-Founders)</strong></span>
        <span>Reading Time: <strong>11 Minutes (2,300 Words)</strong></span>
        <span>Focus: <strong>Erg Chebbi Glamping &amp; Sahara Camps</strong></span>
      </div>
    </header>

